  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensure equitable access for quality health services to the most vulnerable people, IDPs and host communities in North West Syria.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRD aims to enhance access to essential life-saving healthcare services by implementing integrated services across multiple sectors. This includes delivering Primary Health Care services, Basic Reproductive Health services, Mental Health Services, conducting screenings and follow-ups for Malnutrition, as well as engaging in GBV and WASH activities. This initiative involves the direct operation of two BEmONC facilities, one Mobile Unit, and the installation of pre-fabricated latrines.</narrative>
  </description>
